        <mxCell id="3hi2n3ITI6SyvrgfJZz8-75" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;데이터 관리&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;도서 데이터 관리 — 마스터/센터 실물 도서 CRUD, 삭제 도서함(복구), 이미지 업로드, 재고 현황, 대여·반납 처리, 문제 출제(기본/심화, 학년별 고정 슬롯, 엑셀 업로드), 본사/비본사 권한 분기&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;권장도서 순위 — 학년 7개 탭, 드래그앤드롭 순위 편집, 초안 저장(즉시 적용/내년 예약), 초안 목록·미리보기·적용·삭제, 엑셀 다운로드&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;레벨/뱃지 관리 — 레벨(1~30)·학년별 EXP·뱃지 22종 관리&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;운영관리&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;4. 운영 현황 — 센터별 이용/운영 대시보드 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;5. 기관 관리 — 센터 등록/수정/상태 관리 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;6. 선생님 관리 — 관리자 계정 관리 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;모니터링&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;7. 독서 모니터링 — 대여/추천 현황 조회 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;8. 학생 진행 현황 — 학생별 레벨·EXP·완독 이력 조회 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;9. 결과 관리 — 문제풀이 점수/등급 결과 조회 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;성장관리&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;10. 성장 리포트 — 학생 성장 리포트 &lt;em&gt;(미착수)&lt;/em&gt;&#xa;11. 리워드 관리 — 보상 관리 &lt;em&gt;(미착수, 기능 미정)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;학생 (PWA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;12&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;로그인 — appId 입력(추후 QR), 실패 메시지&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;메인 — 자동 도서 추천(우선순위→재고→분류중복제외→학년확장, 멱등+즉시 대여), 추천 카드, 레벨 카드(진행률·다음 레벨까지 N권), 뱃지 패널, 이번 달 읽은 책&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;문제풀이 — 문항 조회, 4지선다 풀이, 서버 채점 제출&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;결과 — 등급 3단계(독서왕/독서친구/재도전), EXP 적립·레벨업, 신규 뱃지 표시, 심화문제 분기&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;공통&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;16&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;PWA — 홈 화면 설치, 오프라인 캐싱, 서비스워커 갱신&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;공통 코드 관리 (API만)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;FCM 푸시 알림 발송/이력 (API만, 화면 없음)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;이미지 업로드/저장&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;인증/권한 (Spring Security, 본사/센터 구분)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; margin-top: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;학부모 앱 (Flutter)&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(미착수, 기능 미정)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol start=&quot;21&quot; style=&quot;padding-inline-start: 2em; color: rgb(204, 204, 204); font-family: -apple-system, &amp;quot;system-ui&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(40, 44, 52); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;자녀 독서 현황·레벨·뱃지 조회, 알림 수신 등 (후보)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="620" width="560" x="40" y="1190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
